@startuml Create Loyalty Program Sequence

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Create Loyalty Program Flow

actor "Business Owner" as Owner
participant "Program Wizard" as UI
participant "API Controller" as API
participant "LoyaltyProgramService" as ProgramSvc
participant "EarningRuleService" as EarningSvc
participant "RedemptionRuleService" as RedemptionSvc
participant "ICustomerLoyaltyPlatformContext" as DB
participant "Event Publisher" as Events

Owner -> UI: Start program setup
activate UI

UI --> Owner: Show program type selection

Owner -> UI: Select "Points Based"
Owner -> UI: Enter program name\nand points name

UI --> Owner: Show earning rule config

Owner -> UI: Configure earning rule\n(1 point per $1 spent)

UI --> Owner: Show redemption rule config

Owner -> UI: Configure redemption\n($5 off for 100 points)

Owner -> UI: Review and confirm

UI -> API: POST /api/programs\n{programConfig}
activate API

API -> ProgramSvc: CreateProgram(command)
activate ProgramSvc

ProgramSvc -> DB: Save LoyaltyProgram
activate DB
DB --> ProgramSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

ProgramSvc -> Events: Publish(LoyaltyProgramCreated)
activate Events
Events --> ProgramSvc: Published
deactivate Events

ProgramSvc --> API: Program created
deactivate ProgramSvc

API -> EarningSvc: ConfigureRule(earningRule)
activate EarningSvc

EarningSvc -> DB: Save EarningRule
activate DB
DB --> EarningSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

EarningSvc -> Events: Publish(EarningRuleConfigured)
EarningSvc --> API: Rule configured
deactivate EarningSvc

API -> RedemptionSvc: ConfigureRule(redemptionRule)
activate RedemptionSvc

RedemptionSvc -> DB: Save RedemptionRule
activate DB
DB --> RedemptionSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

RedemptionSvc -> Events: Publish(RedemptionRuleConfigured)
RedemptionSvc --> API: Rule configured
deactivate RedemptionSvc

API --> UI: 201 Created\n{programId}
deactivate API

UI --> Owner: Show success\nProgram ready for members

@enduml
